    <section id="yp-section">
        <div class="container px-5">
            <div class="page-wrap">

                <div class="page-header">
                    <h1>Yarn Points Policy</h1>
                    <p>Everything you need to know about earning, accumulating, and converting your Yarn Points.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- What are Yarn Points -->
                <div class="section-card">
                    <h2><i class="fa fa-circle-info"></i> What are Yarn Points?</h2>
                    <p>Yarn Points are BeeYarn's reward currency. Every time you contribute to the platform — by posting, engaging, referring friends, going live, or simply showing up daily — you earn Yarn Points. Once you meet the payout requirements, your points can be converted to real money in your local currency.</p>
                    <p>Points are credited automatically. You can check your balance at any time in the app under <strong>Profile &rarr; Yarn Points</strong>.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- How to earn -->
                <div class="section-card">
                    <h2><i class="fa fa-star"></i> How to Earn Yarn Points <span class="max-day-badge" id="max-per-day">Max 60 pts/day</span></h2>
                    <p>Points are earned across several activities. A daily cap applies to your total earnings per day.</p>

                    <table class="points-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Activity</th>
                                <th>Points Earned</th>
                                <th>Daily Limit</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Daily login</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-login">0.3 pts</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit" id="lim-login">0.3 pts/day</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Creating a post</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-post">1.5 pts</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit" id="lim-post">1.5 pts/day</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Liking a post (you give the like)</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-like-giver">0.3 pts</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit" id="lim-like-giver">6 pts/day</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Receiving a like on your post</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-like-receiver">0.3 pts per like</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit">No set limit</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Commenting on a post</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-comment">0.6 pts</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit" id="lim-comment">6 pts/day</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Receiving a comment on your post</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-comment-owner">0.3 pts per comment</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit">No set limit</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Engagement milestone — every 10 likes received</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-eng-likes">0.3 pts</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit">—</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Engagement milestone — every 5 comments received</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-eng-comments">0.6 pts</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit">—</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Sharing a post</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-share">0.075 pts per share</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit" id="lim-share">3 pts/day</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>New real connection (mutual follow)</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-connection">0.9 pts</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit" id="lim-connection">1.5 pts/day</td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <!-- Live streams -->
                <div class="section-card">
                    <h2><i class="fa fa-tower-broadcast"></i> Live Streaming Points</h2>
                    <p>Going live is one of the fastest ways to earn on BeeYarn. Points are earned by both hosts and viewers.</p>
                    <table class="points-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Activity</th>
                                <th>Points Earned</th>
                                <th>Limit</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Hosting a live stream</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-live-host">1.5 pts</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit" id="lim-live-day">Max 3 lives/day</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Watching a live stream</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-live-viewer">0.6 pts</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit" id="lim-live-viewer">9 pts/day</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Hosting — bonus for 10 minutes streamed</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-live-10min">1.5 pts</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit">Per session</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Hosting — bonus for 100 viewers reached</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-live-100viewers">4.5 pts</td>
                                <td class="daily-limit">Per session</td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                    <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #6B7280;">Minimum watch time of <span id="min-watch-sec">—</span> seconds required before viewer points are credited. Maximum live duration per session is set by BeeYarn and may vary — check the app for the current limit.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Referrals -->
                <div class="section-card">
                    <h2><i class="fa fa-user-plus"></i> Referral Points</h2>
                    <p>Share your unique referral link and earn points when people you invite take action on BeeYarn.</p>
                    <table class="points-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Referral Action</th>
