                                <td>Your referral creates their first post</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-ref-firstpost">1.5 pts</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>Your referral stays active for 7 days</td>
                                <td class="pts" id="pts-ref-7days">3 pts</td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                    <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #6B7280;">Get your referral link in the app: <strong>Profile &rarr; Settings &rarr; Refer &amp; Earn</strong>.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Milestones -->
                <div class="section-card">
                    <h2><i class="fa fa-trophy"></i> Milestone Bonuses</h2>
                    <p>Earn one-time bonus points for hitting key milestones on BeeYarn.</p>
                    <div class="milestone-grid">
                        <div class="milestone-item">
                            <span class="label">Complete your profile</span>
                            <span class="pts" id="ms-profile">1.5 pts</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="milestone-item">
                            <span class="label">Verify your email</span>
                            <span class="pts" id="ms-email">1.5 pts</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="milestone-item">
                            <span class="label">Create your first post</span>
                            <span class="pts" id="ms-firstpost">1.5 pts</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="milestone-item">
                            <span class="label">Reach 10 posts created</span>
                            <span class="pts" id="ms-10posts">3 pts</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="milestone-item">
                            <span class="label">Reach your first 100 followers</span>
                            <span class="pts" id="ms-100followers">6 pts</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="milestone-item">
                            <span class="label">Every <span id="ms-likes-interval">150</span> likes received</span>
                            <span class="pts" id="ms-likes-pts">3 pts</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="milestone-item">
                            <span class="label">Every <span id="ms-views-interval">75</span> views received</span>
                            <span class="pts" id="ms-views-pts">0.3 pts</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Payout requirements -->
                <div class="section-card">
                    <h2><i class="fa fa-lock-open"></i> Payout Requirements</h2>
                    <p>To convert your Yarn Points to cash, you must meet all of the following requirements:</p>
                    <div class="req-row">
                        <i class="fa fa-circle-check req-icon"></i>
                        <div>
                            <span><strong>Verify your identity</strong> — go to <strong>Settings &rarr; Verify Identity</strong></span>
                            <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#6B7280; margin-top:0.25rem;">Submit a valid ID document of your choice and your bank account details. Your bank account name must match the name on the ID document provided. Verification is processed by the BeeYarn admin team and typically takes a few days — start this early as it must be completed before you can cash out.</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="req-row">
                        <i class="fa fa-circle-check req-icon"></i>
                        <span>Reach <strong><span id="min-followers">10,000</span> followers</strong> on BeeYarn</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="req-row">
                        <i class="fa fa-circle-check req-icon"></i>
                        <div>
                            <span>Hold an active subscription for <strong><span id="sub-months">3</span> consecutive months</strong></span>
                            <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#6B7280; margin-top:0.25rem;"><i class="fa fa-gear" style="color:#1C5B31;"></i> Settings &rarr; Subscription &rarr; Subscribe &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <strong style="color:#92400e;">Tip:</strong> Enable auto-renewal to avoid breaking your streak — a lapsed subscription resets your consecutive count.</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="req-row">
                        <i class="fa fa-circle-check req-icon"></i>
                        <span>Accumulate a minimum balance of <strong><span id="min-points">10,000</span> Yarn Points</strong></span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Conversion rates -->
                <div class="section-card">
                    <h2><i class="fa fa-money-bill-wave"></i> Point-to-Cash Conversion Rates</h2>
                    <p>Once you're eligible to cash out, your Yarn Points are converted at the following rates:</p>
                    <table class="currency-table" id="currency-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Country</th>
                                <th>Currency</th>
                                <th>Value per Yarn Point</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody id="currency-tbody">
                            <tr><td colspan="3" class="loading">Loading rates...</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <!-- Tracking points -->
                <div class="section-card">
                    <h2><i class="fa fa-clock-rotate-left"></i> Tracking Your Points</h2>
                    <p>To see a full history of every point you have received, go to:</p>
                    <div style="background:#f3f7f4; border:1px solid #d1e7d8; border-radius:6px; padding:0.75rem 1rem; font-size:0.92rem; color:#1C5B31; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">
                        Settings &rarr; Points and Earnings History
                    </div>
                    <p>Here you'll see a complete log of all points credited to your account — broken down by activity, date, and amount.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Monetisation dashboard -->
                <div class="section-card">
                    <h2><i class="fa fa-wallet"></i> Monetisation Dashboard</h2>
                    <p>To manage your earnings and cash out, go to:</p>
                    <div style="background:#f3f7f4; border:1px solid #d1e7d8; border-radius:6px; padding:0.75rem 1rem; font-size:0.92rem; color:#1C5B31; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">
                        Settings &rarr; Monetisation
                    </div>
                    <p>From your Monetisation dashboard you can:</p>
                    <ul style="padding-left:1.25rem; margin-bottom:0;">
                        <li style="font-size:0.97rem; color:#374151; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">See which payout requirements are still pending and track your progress towards each one</li>
                        <li style="font-size:0.97rem; color:#374151; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">View your current available Yarn Points balance</li>
                        <li style="font-size:0.97rem; color:#374151; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">See the exchange rate to various currencies</li>
                        <li style="font-size:0.97rem; color:#374151; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Request a payout once all requirements are met</li>
                        <li style="font-size:0.97rem; color:#374151;">View your full payout history</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p style="margin-top:0.75rem; font-size:0.88rem; color:#6B7280;">Note: A cooldown period applies between payout requests. Once a payout is requested, you will need to wait until your next eligible date before submitting another request. Your next eligible payout date is shown in the Monetisation dashboard.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="notice-box">
                    <strong>Please note:</strong> Point values, earning rates, daily limits, and payout thresholds are subject to change. While this page attempts to reflect current values, always check the app under <strong>Settings &rarr; Monetisation</strong> for the most accurate and up-to-date figures. BeeYarn reserves the right to update these values at any time.
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
